					"content": "「警探」…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750391810,
					"content": "我曾經在逐影庭做過幾年警探，跟隨法蘭克·德雷賓警督辦過幾件大案，後來他升任警司，而我退役了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391811,
					"content": "那還真是讓人難忘的時光…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391812,
					"content": "是啊…男孩遇見女孩，男孩失去女孩，女孩尋找男孩，男孩忘記女孩，男孩記起女孩，女孩被千靈節的映影花車碾壓了三遍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391813,
					"content": "那種亂七八糟的時光還是不要回顧啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391832,
					"content": "咳咳…總之，從逐影庭退役以後，我無所事事了一段時間，最終決定還是做個攝影家，描摹人與物所蘊含的生命力…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391833,
					"content": "所以我來到了這裡，納塔！諸元素生命力最為璀璨驚心的國度！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391834,
					"content": "是很驚心啦…你差點就乾死在這裡了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391835,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，實在是不好意思，我是不會忘記{F#妳}{M#你}們救我一命的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391836,
					"content": "#唔…對了，借{F#妳}{M#你}們的地圖看一下。嗯…我看看接下來我的目的地是在哪裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391837,
					"content": "啊！對了…我的禮貌跑去哪裡了！我還不知道你們的名字。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391838,
					"content": "#我是{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391839
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750391839,
					"content": "#叫我派蒙就好！還有牠，牠叫{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391840,
					"content": "嗯唔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391841,
					"content": "#很好，{NICKNAME}和派蒙，我記住了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391842,
					"content": "嗯？唔？嚇——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391843,
					"content": "#哈哈，不要急不要急！還有{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391844,
					"content": "#希望不久後我們能在旅途中再次相見，說不定下次我又要拜託{F#妳}{M#你}們幫忙，又說不定我可以幫上{F#妳}{M#你}們的忙哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391845
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391845,
					"content": "哇…你要去這麼遠的地方啊…那小心不要再把自己渴到乾掉了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391846,
					"content": "哈哈，不會的！我們有機會再見囉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391847
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391847,
					"content": "#馬尼菲科飛快地打包好行李與飲水，向{F#妳}{M#你}們揮手告別。\\n不一會，他矮小的身影便從{F#妳}{M#你}們的視野中消失了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750391814,
					"content": "「布魯圖斯」…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750391815,
					"content": "#啊，{F#妳}{M#你}可能不知道，我曾在逐影庭做過幾年警探，那時候是法蘭克·德雷賓警督的部下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391816,
					"content": "當時我們在公園裡，看到五個穿長袍的傢伙在一百多人面前用刀襲擊一個老頭，於是「砰、砰、砰、砰、砰！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391817,
					"content": "我們把他們全部撂倒了，地上沒有一個在呼吸的——哈，你覺得自己很幸運嗎，小賊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391818,
					"content": "哇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391819,
					"content": "哇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391820,
					"content": "後來警長告訴我，那是一幫科學院的行政科員，正在排練《雷穆利亞》。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391821,
					"content": "欸？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391822,
					"content": "所以，「布魯圖斯」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391823,
					"content": "嗚嗷？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391824,
					"content": "不過反正沒什麼關係，當時科學院正在裁撤冗員，他們遲早會被開除。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391825,
					"content": "「磁先生」…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750391826,
					"content": "當然是說我超凡的人格魅力，每個認識我的人都會不可避免地被我所吸引！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391827,
					"content": "噫…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391828,
					"content": "以及…所有不起眼的金屬小物品、零散摩拉、細小首飾什麼的，都會莫名其妙被吸引到我的口袋裡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391829,
					"content": "那應該叫「偷竊癖」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391830,
					"content": "沒錯，那正是我們家族的美德之一！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750391831,
					"content": "咿——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750391832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}